7
00:00:13,904 --> 00:00:15,974
W-W-What about what you
said in the restaurant?

8
00:00:15,973 --> 00:00:17,003
(Penny:)Well, it's not forever.

9
00:00:17,007 --> 00:00:18,607
(Penny:)It's just for a while.

10
00:00:18,609 --> 00:00:21,979
(Penny:)If you want, we can think of him
like he's our dog.

11
00:00:21,979 --> 00:00:24,109
(Penny:)You can.

12
00:00:24,882 --> 00:00:26,512
(Sheldon:)I'm happy when you come home.

13
00:00:27,684 --> 00:00:29,754
(Sheldon:)And I'm scared of fireworks.

14
00:00:29,753 --> 00:00:33,293
