we're all sleeping here.

15
00:00:33,290 --> 00:00:35,560
(Sheldon:)Fine.

16
00:00:35,559 --> 00:00:36,659
All right, great!

17
00:00:36,660 --> 00:00:37,860
(Sheldon:)Just give me one minute,

18
00:00:37,861 --> 00:00:40,031
(Sheldon:)and I'll get started
on a new Roommate Agreement.

19
00:00:40,030 --> 00:00:41,160
(Sheldon:)Yeah.

20
